Yes. Let's take **each Observation type in your current Galaxy code**, separate the fields, and explain **what each one means and why Galaxy collects it**.

The easiest way to understand it is:

> **Observation metadata tells Galaxy what/when/where the fact came from. `data` tells Galaxy the actual fact.**

